  <bpmn:task id="Bridge_3_1e27" name="**Transition sentence (Process A → Process B)**  &#10;Once the work‑accident reporting and documentation steps are finished, the affected individual initiates the university enrollment process, thereby moving from Process A to Process B.  &#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;### University Enrollment Process (Process B) – roles, key activities and decision points  &#10;&#10;| Step | Activity (Key) | Role(s) Involved | Decision Point |&#10;|------|----------------|------------------|----------------|&#10;| 1 | **Student submits online application** | Student | — |&#10;| 2 | **Admissions office reviews application and supporting documents** | Admissions Office | — |&#10;| 3 | **If documents are missing → notify applicant** | Admissions Office | **Document completeness?** (If incomplete → return to step 2) |&#10;| 4 | **Application evaluation** *(key activity)* | Admissions Office | **Application acceptance?** (Accept → step 5; Reject → send rejection letter → end) |&#10;| 5 | **Send acceptance letter** | Admissions Office | — |&#10;| 6 | **Finance department processes application fees or waivers** | Finance Department | — |&#10;| 7 | **Student confirms enrollment by deadline** | Student | **Enrollment confirmation?** (Confirmed → step 8; Not confirmed → application canceled → end) |&#10;| 8 | **IT department sets up student accounts (email, portal, library)** | IT Department | — |&#10;| 9 | **Academic advisor assists student with study‑plan creation** *(key activity)* | Academic Advisor, Student | — |&#10;| 10 | **Student creates study plan** – meets advisor, selects courses, resolves schedule conflicts | Student, Academic Advisor | — |&#10;| 11 | **Student begins attending classes** | Student | — |&#10;| 12 | **Add/Drop courses during add/drop period** | Student | — |&#10;| 13 | **Grades posted; student reviews online** | Student | — |&#10;| 14 | **If grievances → appeal process** (submit form, meet appeals committee, await decision) | Student, Appeals Committee | — |&#10;| 15 | **Repeat steps 12‑14 each semester until graduation or withdrawal** | All relevant roles | — |&#10;&#10;**Key Elements Highlighted**  &#10;- **Roles:** Student, Admissions Office, Finance Department, IT Department, Academic Advisor.  &#10;- **Key Activities:** *Application evaluation* (step 4) and *Study‑plan creation* (steps 9‑10).  &#10;- **Decision Points:** *Application acceptance* (step 4) and *Enrollment confirmation* (step 7).  &#10;&#10;This structure satisfies the design request while clearly showing how the completion of Process A (work‑accident reporting) leads directly into Process B (university enrollment)." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_3" sourceRef="atom_2_ExclusiveGateway_8" targetRef="Bridge_3_1e27" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_3" sourceRef="Bridge_3_1e27" targetRef="atom_3_Task_23" /><bpmn:extensionElements />
